@startuml
title Valetax Support Ticket Co-Pilot - Processing Activity
start
:Accept ticket identifier and text;
:Validate schema and supported input;
if (Valid input?) then (no)
  :Return typed safe error;
  :Require human review;
  stop
endif
:Run deterministic pre-policy and injection checks;
if (Protected or adversarial intent?) then (yes)
  :Refuse or acknowledge without decision;
  :Require human review with reason;
  stop
endif
:Classify category, urgency, language, sentiment;
:Retrieve allowlisted snapshot sections;
if (Retrieval available?) then (no)
  :Abstain with dependency failure;
  :Require human review;
  stop
endif
if (Evidence sufficient and consistent?) then (no)
  :Abstain with gap or conflict reason;
  :Require human review;
  stop
endif
:Draft only from accepted evidence;
:Run claim, citation, prompt-injection, and policy validation;
if (Draft safe and fully supported?) then (yes)
  :Return cited draft for agent review;
else (no)
  :Discard draft;
  :Return abstention and human route;
endif
:Record redacted audit metadata and measurements;
stop
@enduml
